      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had the same problem, don't know if the cause is the same though. For me it was a load balanced internet uplink with two different public IP addresses whereas the login through vrchat.com happened from the first ISP and first IP address and a subsequent call to pipeline.vrchat.cloud was done from the secondary ISP and therefore secondary IP address. The Websocket server didn't like that my request came from a secondary IP address, has thrown an error through the WS connection and the web UI logged me out.\n\nThe error the WS server throws is:\n\n{\"err\":\"authToken doesn't correspond with an active session\",\"authToken\":\"authcookie_REMOVED\",\"ip\":\"REMOVED\"}",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
